# P12 round 7 step 2: the A/B mode of the Synth play page on the Tracker Mini, Mini keys only. Menu box 12 (Up then Left from the Pattern
# box) opens the page on Synth 1 (part A), Right x4 goes to the Synth B column and Up turns part B on (Synth 2), the pair shares the stock
# pool of 8 voices as 4 + 4. Left x2 goes to Morph and Up steps it from 50 to 55. Middle held plays C4 on both parts, the release ends it,
# Menu with Right and Up x2 goes to the Pattern box and leaves the page. plus_flows.sh reads the page state afterwards
# (UISHOT_TRACE_SPLAY): open with B on and 4 voices on each side, a held cell, none after the release, and the last line closed.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Synth play A/B on the Mini (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Up
wait 300ms
tap Left
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
expect text "Synth B"
tap Right x4
wait 300ms
tap Up
wait 600ms
tap Left x2
wait 300ms
tap Up
wait 600ms
press Mid
wait 500ms
shot ab
release Mid
wait 500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
tap Up x2
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
